{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1767847762_8971719_f041ae20fbb8b852110263cc599313f5.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3><b>Partner with Catholight: Spread the Light</b></h3><ul><li><p><b>About our brand and products:</b> Catholight creates premium leather bags and meaningful jewelry for the modern Catholic woman. We blend timeless, high-end design with sacred symbolism to create pieces that honor both faith and style.</p></li><li><p><b>What makes us different:</b> We offer <b>\"evangelization through elegance.\"</b> Our products serve as a \"silent witness,\" allowing women to carry their faith into every space—from the workplace to the sanctuary—with beauty and grace.</p></li><li><p><b>How affiliates can earn:</b> As an Ambassador of Light, you’ll give your community a <b>20% discount</b> on their purchase. In return, you earn a <b>10% commission</b> on every sale you inspire.</p></li><li><p><b>How to promote us:</b> Share your \"Daily Grace\" by featuring our pieces in your Sunday best, prayer routines, or gift guides for Sacraments like Confirmation, RCIA, and weddings.</p></li><li><p><b>Other information:</b> Join a mission-driven community dedicated to spreading the Gospel. We provide all the creative assets and support you need to share your faith authentically.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
